      "message": "[error] Line 228: 🔴 `setParticipants(from:accountURI:)` regresses local-participant detection for non-hash URIs (notably SIP). `localJamiId` is computed as `JamiURI(from: accountURI).hash`, which is `nil` for SIP addresses, so `isLocal` is always false. This changes behavior compared to the previous normalization and can break logic that relies on identifying the local member. Normalize both sides with the same fallback (e.g. `JamiURI(from: accountURI).hash ?? accountURI`) before comparing.",
